#: socks.cpp:260
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>Ovaj modul vam omogućuje da podesite KDE podršku za SOCKS server ili "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS je protokol za obilaženje firewall-a koji je opisan u <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>Ako nemate ideje šta je ovo, a vaš vam administrator ne kaže da ga "
"trebate koristiti, ostavite ga isključenog.</p>"

